<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Botanicals 40903 Mini Poinsettias GWP Gift with Purchase December 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Pieces: 232</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 18+ Adults Welcome</li>
<li>Promo Period (Unconfirmed): Most likely in December 2026</li>
<li>How to Get (Unconfirmed): Most likely have to spend a certain amount at LEGO to get the gift set for free</li>
</ul>
