										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=eabb95a3ad84516aec055a5a1916c2f0&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115432 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-November-27-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1027" height="838" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-November-27-2026.jpg 1027w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-November-27-2026-300x245.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-November-27-2026-1024x836.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-November-27-2026-768x627.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1027px) 100vw, 1027px" /></a></p>
<p>Today is officially Black Friday! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> has started their LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026. More deals have now been added. There are now over 25 LEGO sets discounted along with a much of other apparel stuff. There are two different formats as to how the sales are displayed so you check out the list <a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=eabb95a3ad84516aec055a5a1916c2f0&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a> and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=lego&amp;i=black-friday&amp;bbn=384082011&amp;rh=n%3A384082011%2Cp_123%3A249943%2Cp_6%3AATVPDKIKX0DER&amp;dc=&amp;crid=W0G2H216SBVU&amp;qid=1795778764&amp;rnid=275224011&amp;sprefix=le%2Cblack-friday%2C194&amp;ds=v1%3ATCl%2BjLOrAD6OwPUl0WbAxYPaoZTu24b0tTIkP5xQe8I&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=2e49edd9cd1542049c5216a4b16081bd&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>.</p>
<p>My picks would probably be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Mandalorian-Lambda-Class/dp/B0G2T1LDKZ?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=a61afb8c5dfd5344472fbcb06b4f6556&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Imperial Lambda-Class Shuttle 75459</a> at 30% off for <strong>$97.99</strong> (reg.$139.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-107639 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-107638 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="918" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x230.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x783.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75459-Imperial-Lambda-Class-Shuttle-Summer-July-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x588.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Thestral-Family/dp/B0DRW5SRH5?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=cf384b47987096ad3fc172be7782eff5&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Thestral Family 76458</a> at 40% off for <strong>$41.99</strong> (reg.$69.99) is also a great discount.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96584 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76458-Thestral-Family-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="872" height="845" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76458-Thestral-Family-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 872w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76458-Thestral-Family-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x291.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76458-Thestral-Family-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x744.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 872px) 100vw, 872px" /></p>
<p>Lastly, you can&#8217;t go wrong with the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Transformers-Collectible-Movie-Themed-Enthusiasts/dp/B0CV2KBSKP?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=69244ad1b6a27cc4ee71b7f7893d6472&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Icons Transformers Bumblebee 10338</a> at <strong>$62.99</strong> (reg.$89.99) which works out to be 30% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-90060 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="864" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Front-Box.jpg 600w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Front-Box-208x300.jpg 208w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-90061 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="874" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Back-Box.jpg 600w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10338-Bumblebee-Transformers-July-2024-Set-Images-Back-Box-206x300.jpg 206w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=eabb95a3ad84516aec055a5a1916c2f0&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115433 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-2-November-27-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1039" height="866" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-2-November-27-2026.jpg 1039w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-2-November-27-2026-300x250.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-2-November-27-2026-1024x853.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-List-2-November-27-2026-768x640.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1039px) 100vw, 1039px" /></a></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
