					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1800" height="1800" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Star Wars 75453 Offworld Sandcrawler and Mudhorn Summer August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75453-Offworld-Sandcrawler-and-Mudhorn-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1536x1536.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1800px) 100vw, 1800px" /></p>
<p>Amazon Canada LEGO Black Friday 2026 deals continue. There are over 200 LEGO sets discounted for Black Friday</p>
