										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115377 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1036" height="881" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg 1036w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-300x255.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-1024x871.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-768x653.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> LEGO Black Friday 2026 deals continue. There are <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 200 LEGO sets discounted for Black Friday 2026 at Amazon Canada</a>. Note that they have now added a few more new sets. I like to point out that they have the <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-6590478-TBD-2026-72154/dp/B0G2SZ6DS8?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=f3d472f97299566b9866374f4706de0e&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Iconic Trainer Moments Poké Ball 72154</a> for<strong> $335.99</strong> (reg.$419.99). Savings work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110590 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="792" height="792" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72154-Iconic-Trainer-Moments-Poke-Ball-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 792px) 100vw, 792px" /></p>
