										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Thanksgiving American LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some deals for this late afternoon. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p>Below are 9 of our Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 26, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email list so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<h3>9 Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 26, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>50% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-City-Williams-Racing-Haas/dp/B0DJ17WGMB?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=68e536a95693f7f3b50e4992278dfdab&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City F1 Williams Racing &amp; Haas F1 Race Car 60464</a> <strong>$9.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
<li>50% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Speed-Champions-Audi-Revolut/dp/B0FMYTJ93W?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=15832dec383250bc5cfaf7e648d3548a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions Audi Revolut F1 Team R26 Race Car 77259</a> <strong>$13.99</strong> (reg.$27.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-105194 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77259-Audi-Revolut-F1-Team-R26-Race-Car-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="858" height="843" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77259-Audi-Revolut-F1-Team-R26-Race-Car-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77259-Audi-Revolut-F1-Team-R26-Race-Car-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77259-Audi-Revolut-F1-Team-R26-Race-Car-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x755.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-105185 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box.webp" alt="" width="827" height="547" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box.webp 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box-300x198.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box-1024x677.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box-768x508.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Audi-Revolut-R26-Box-1536x1015.webp 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 827px) 100vw, 827px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92572 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="972" height="831" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 972w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x256.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60464-Formula-1-F1-Williams-Racing-Haas-F1-Race-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x657.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 972px) 100vw, 972px" /></p>
