					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="948" height="787" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="US Macy&#039;s LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 List Round 3 Ends November 27, 2026" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026.jpg 948w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026-300x249.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026-768x638.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 948px) 100vw, 948px" /></p>
<p>Macy&#8217;s US Online has started their round 3 LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026! You can now save up</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-macys-black-friday-lego-deals-2026-round-3-now-live-save-up-to-50-off-over-100-sets-to-choose-from/">[US] Macy&#8217;s Black Friday LEGO Deals 2026 Round 3 Now Live: Save Up to 50% off (Over 100 Sets to Choose From)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.dpbolvw.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fbrands%2Flego%2FBusiness_category%2CSpecial_offers%2FToys%2CBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%257CToday%2520Only%3Fid%3D200756" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115394 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026.jpg" alt="" width="948" height="787" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026.jpg 948w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026-300x249.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/US-Macys-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-Round-3-Ends-November-27-2026-768x638.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 948px) 100vw, 948px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fsearch%3Fkeyword%3Dlego" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macy&#8217;s US Online</a> has started their round 3 LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026! You can now save up to 50% off selected LEGO sets. Though, most deals are around 20% off. Deals end on November 27, 2026 or while supplies last. There are <a href="https://www.dpbolvw.net/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fbrands%2Flego%2FBusiness_category%2CSpecial_offers%2FToys%2CBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%257CToday%2520Only%3Fid%3D200756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">currently over 100 sets discounted</a>.</p>
<p>Also, although not 50% off, they do have the <a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-ideas-day-of-the-dead-la-catrina-21372-1212-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D27485518%23BUSINESS_CATEGORY%2CSPECIAL_OFFERS%2FToys%2CBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%7CToday%2520Only" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas La Catrina 21372</a> on sale for $111.99 (reg.$139.99). Savings work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-ideas-day-of-the-dead-la-catrina-21372-1212-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D27485518%23BUSINESS_CATEGORY%2CSPECIAL_OFFERS%2FToys%2CBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%7CToday%2520Only" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110858 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="878" height="878" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 878px) 100vw, 878px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-ideas-day-of-the-dead-la-catrina-21372-1212-piece-building-set-ages-18%3FID%3D27485518%23BUSINESS_CATEGORY%2CSPECIAL_OFFERS%2FToys%2CBlack%2520Friday%2520Deal%7CToday%2520Only" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110874 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="617" height="908" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 815w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-204x300.png 204w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-695x1024.png 695w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-IDEAS-21372-La-Catrina-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x1131.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 617px) 100vw, 617px" /></a></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
