		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Toys N Bricks]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:08:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales Canada]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115366</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="504" height="792" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Week 2 List" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg 504w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List-191x300.jpg 191w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px" /></p>
<p>Wal-Mart Canada Online LEGO Black Friday Deals Week 2 Offers for 2026 have just started and are now</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-week-2-now-live-40-off-selected-sets/">[Canada] Wal-Mart LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Week 2 Now Live: 40% off Selected Sets</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> LEGO Black Friday Deals Week 2 Offers for 2026 have just started and are now live! Sale starts online from Wednesday, November 25 at 9pm EST and runs until Sunday, November 29 at 8:59pm EST. For in-store brick &amp; mortar, deals start on Thursday, November 26 and ends on Wednesday, December 2.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday-weekly-flyer%2F9545451864132%3FcatId%3D10011%26icid%3Ddeals_page_other_toys_hcm_web_210065_UESLLD1JOU%26facet%3Dpgls_mp_seller_name%253AWalmart%257C%257Cbrand%253ALEGO" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115373 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg" alt="" width="504" height="792" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List.jpg 504w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Week-2-List-191x300.jpg 191w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px" /></a></p>
<p>There are <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday-weekly-flyer%2F9545451864132%3FcatId%3D10011%26icid%3Ddeals_page_other_toys_hcm_web_210065_UESLLD1JOU%26facet%3Dpgls_mp_seller_name%253AWalmart%257C%257Cbrand%253ALEGO" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 10 LEGO sets discounte</a>d and many of them are discounted by 40% off. A few of them have even higher percentage discounts. My pick would probably be the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-Star-Wars-Death-Trooper-Night-Battle-Pack-Kids-Toy-Building-Set-Pretend-Play-Ahsoka-Series-Model-Kit-Boys-Girls-Ages-6-Birthday-Gift-Idea-Movie%2F1MB2R7HWYRWB%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars 75412 Death Trooper &amp; Night Trooper Battle Pack</a> for <strong>$14.86</strong> (reg.$24.99). This set is currently marked as sold out at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a>. However, it is now 40% off at Wal-Mart.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-Star-Wars-Death-Trooper-Night-Battle-Pack-Kids-Toy-Building-Set-Pretend-Play-Ahsoka-Series-Model-Kit-Boys-Girls-Ages-6-Birthday-Gift-Idea-Movie%2F1MB2R7HWYRWB%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96501 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75412-Death-Trooper-Night-Trooper-Battle-Pack-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="878" height="850" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75412-Death-Trooper-Night-Trooper-Battle-Pack-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 878w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75412-Death-Trooper-Night-Trooper-Battle-Pack-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x290.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75412-Death-Trooper-Night-Trooper-Battle-Pack-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x744.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 878px) 100vw, 878px" /></a></p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that <span style="font-weight: 400;">prefer mobile device real time push notifications </span> for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>*<strong>More great LEGO sales buys can be found on the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Dlego%26facet%3Dfacet_ss_BestSellers%253ABestSellers%257C%257Cretailer_type%253AWalmart%26affinityOverride%3Ddefault" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Bestsellers List</a>. </strong>Make sure to filter the seller to Wal-Mart Canada (and not third party sellers) and choose Best Selling Items.</p>
<p>We also have a <strong><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
